_label">Open Build</span></button></div><p id=":id:">Opens the real goal behind the selected work item. Escape closes the most recent layer.</p></div><div><div><section aria-label="Your requests" data-slot="request_trail"><p>Your requests</p><p>Nothing prepared or sent from the World yet. Prepare a brief at the Arrival table.</p><p>A sent request becomes tracked work only when a goal exists. If the Steward owns it, it appears under Steward goals; other goals are listed at the Arrival table.</p></section><section aria-labelledby="world-slot-steward_goals" data-slot="steward_goals" data-slot-state="error" data-stale="true"><h4><span><span id="world-slot-steward_goals">Steward goals</span><span>Disconnected</span></span></h4><p data-failure="disconnected">Can’t reach the daemon. This is a lost connection, not a failed task.</p><p><span>Stale</span> Last good data from 15 min ago:</p><div role="listbox" aria-label="Steward goals"><button type="button" role="option" class="pa-btn pa-btn--composite" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" data-record-key="goal:fixture-project-garden/fixture-goal-1"><span>Draft the launch page outline</span><span data-stage="tracked"><span>Tracked goal</span> Executing · updated 19 min ago · 0 review decision(s)</span></button></div><div><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Try again</span></button></div></section><section aria-labelledby="world-slot-steward_activity" data-slot="steward_activity" data-slot-state="error" data-stale="true"><h4><span><span id="world-slot-steward_activity">Steward activity</span><span>Disconnected</span></span></h4><p data-failure="disconnected">Can’t reach the daemon. This is a lost connection, not a failed task.</p><p><span>Stale</span> Last good data from 15 min ago:</p><ul><li data-record="fixture-act-1"><span>Started: Draft the launch page outline</span><span>goal event · 19 min ago</span><span><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--bare"><span class="pa-btn__label">Open</span></button></span></li></ul><div><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Try again</span></button></div></section></div><div><section aria-label="Result shelf" data-slot="result_shelf" data-results="0"><p>Result shelf</p><p>No result record yet. A request reaching the server does not put anything on this shelf; only a completed goal does.</p></section><section aria-labelledby="world-slot-decisions" data-slot="decisions" data-slot-state="error" data-stale="true"><h4><span><span id="world-slot-decisions">Needs review</span><span>Disconnected</span></span></h4><p data-failure="disconnected">Can’t reach the daemon. This is a lost connection, not a failed task.</p><p><span>Stale</span> Last known answer (15 min ago): nothing. That may have changed.</p><div><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Try again</span></button></div></section><section aria-labelledby="world-slot-steward_spend" data-slot="steward_spend" data-slot-state="error" data-stale="true"><h4><span><span id="world-slot-steward_spend">Attributed spend</span><span>Disconnected</span></span></h4><p data-failure="disconnected">Can’t reach the daemon. This is a lost connection, not a failed task.</p><p><span>Stale</span> Last good data from 15 min ago:</p><div data-lower-bound="false"><p>$0.08 · 3 call(s), 1 estimated</p><p>Spend attributed through the 1 goal(s) owned by git_steward. Session cost is a separate scope; do not add them.</p></div><div><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Try again</span></button></div></section><section aria-labelledby="world-slot-skills" data-slot="skills" data-slot-state="error" data-stale="true"><h4><span><span id="world-slot-skills">Saved skills</span><span>Disconnected</span></span></h4><p data-failure="disconnected">Can’t reach the daemon. This is a lost connection, not a failed task.</p><p><span>Stale</span> Last known answer (15 min ago): nothing. That may have changed.</p><div><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Try again</span></button></div></section></div></div></div>"`;
